@DotnetApiBatch.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5089

### 商品一覧
GET {{DotnetApiBatch.Api_HostAddress}}/products
Accept: application/json

### 顧客の注文一覧（status で絞り込み可: pending / shipped / cancelled）
GET {{DotnetApiBatch.Api_HostAddress}}/customers/1/orders?status=pending
Accept: application/json

### 注文詳細
GET {{DotnetApiBatch.Api_HostAddress}}/orders/1
Accept: application/json

### 注文作成
POST {{DotnetApiBatch.Api_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 },
    { "productId": 4, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

###
